  "蓝+5%；对连续短传、边中结合额外蓝+15%；对高位压迫、快速渗透额外蓝−15%": "Blue +5%. Extra blue +15% against Short Passing or Wide and Central Play; extra blue -15% against High Press or Quick Penetration.",
  "优先符合本队理念、惯用脚和缺人位置的球员，不仅按身价采购；保留多位置轮换和稳定核心。": "Prioritize players who match the team's philosophy, style of play, and missing positions, not just based on their value; retain multi-position rotation and stable core players.",
  "保留充足工资资金，避免高额赌注和大规模解约，优先免费与低价补缺；成绩目标是稳定发展。": "Retain sufficient wage funds to avoid high bets and large departures, prioritize free and low-cost additions; the goal is stable development.",
  "第5步：到阵容页选择不续约的球员，再推进让其成为自由球员；其余29队由本地AI决定。": "Step 5: Select players for whom you want to end the contract on the roster page, then advance to make them free agents; the remaining 29 teams are decided by the local AI.",
  "新游戏：800人独立随机分配。身价按原生成器四舍五入，实际值与目标整数可能有小幅差异。": "New game: 800 independent random allocation. Value is rounded to the nearest integer; actual values may have slight differences from the target integer.",
  "无常驻；对九锋阵、传控足球、链式防守，原类型前锋蓝+15%、中场绿+15%、后卫红+15%": "No permanent bonus. Against Nine Forwards, Possession Football or Catenaccio: original forwards blue +15%, midfielders green +15%, defenders red +15%.",
  "珍视忠诚度高和长期出场的球员，不轻易挂牌核心；低能力或持续衰退且球队无法负担时仍可理性告别。": "Value loyalty and long-term players; don't easily sell core players; rational part ways with low ability or declining players that the team can't afford.",
  "以可持续盈利为首要目标。优先低价年轻球员，给予出场和训练，溢价出售成熟球员；不为了买人透支工资。": "Prioritize sustainable profitability as the primary goal. Prioritize young players at low cost, provide training and rotation, and sell mature players at a premium; do not use excess budget to buy players.",
  "追求高能力明星和冠军，优先引进市场顶尖球员，保留关键位置替补；只在付费后仍能承担全队工资时购买。": "Prioritize high ability stars and champions; prioritize top market players; retain key positions as substitutes; only buy when the team can afford the entire team's salary.",
  "优先24岁及以下球员，给予训练和轮换，耐心培养；长期培养模式没有年龄奖励时重视低价、有明确属性短板的球员。": "Prioritize 24-year-old or younger players; provide training and rotation; patiently cultivate; do not reward age with an age bonus if the long-term cultivation model does not have one.",
  "欧冠及资格赛优先级最高，关键欧战前在其他赛事合理轮换。国内联赛仍须争取下季欧战资格，不为欧冠放弃基本生存。": "Prioritize the highest UEFA and qualification matches; prioritize key UEFA matches before other matches. Ensure the basic survival of the team in domestic leagues while striving for qualification for the next UEFA season.",
  "可用retire列出主动退役球员，不得与release重复，合计操作后至少留10人。退役永久离开活跃球员池。": "Use the retire option to remove active players from the team; do not repeat release. At least 10 players must remain in the active player pool.",
  "以取得最高竞技成绩为首要目标。宁可使用可支配预算补强短板，不为账面利润出售不可替代的主力；仍必须满足工资约束。": "Prioritize the highest competitive results as the primary goal. Prefer to use budget to strengthen weaknesses rather than sell indispensable main players; still must meet wage constraints.",
  "推进会完成电脑球队比赛，并停在你的赛前。你的比赛按10分钟推进，中场可换人和调整战术。周末伤停-1、疲劳清零。": "The team will complete the computer team match and stop at your pre-match. Your match will be played at 10 minutes, with halftime substitutions and tactical adjustments. Weekend injuries -1, fatigue reset to 0.",
  " 必须体现本队长期经营方针，但不得在公开reason中透露隐藏性格名称、完整内部方针或关系数值；只解释具体动作。": " Must reflect the team's long-term operating strategy, but must not reveal hidden personality names, complete internal strategy, or relationship values in the public reason; only explain specific actions.",
  " 根据实际路线攻防、当前比分、疲劳、替补和可用换人名额作出具体决策。允许保持战术，不要为变化而变化；只使用公开阵容信息。": " Make specific decisions based on the actual route, defense, current score, fatigue, substitutes, and available substitution slots. Allow tactical adjustments; do not change tactics for changes; only use public lineup information.",
  "首次射正且门将判定前触发，取消该次及补射；75%对应路线、25%三后卫随机承担4周停赛；决赛禁用。沿用原版赛后处罚，不在当场减员": "Cancel the first shot on target before the keeper check, including its rebound. A defender receives a 4-week post-match suspension: 75% corresponding lane, 25% random among three defenders. Disabled in finals; no immediate dismissal.",
  "2. 选择俱乐部方向，然后随机签约。\n候选：对应指标前10名（含边界并列）；概率与指标成正比。\n文化使用全队平均好感；不会展示球队供你点选。": "Select club direction, then random sign.",
  "遵循本队长期经营方针，并结合当前资金与赛事阶段调整。竞技优先不代表可违背工资预算。关系越高越友好，低关系时慎重向竞争者出售核心，但关系不自动决定成交。": "Follow the long-term operating strategy of the team and adjust based on current funds and tournament stage. Prioritize competition over budget.",
  "球星迭起：年龄、青年成长、衰退、退役与每季自由新秀。\n\n长期培养：无年龄结算及年度新秀，专注现有球员培养。\n\n模式在本次新建世界时确定，旧存档默认为长期培养。": "Star players: Age, youth development, decline, retirement, and new players each season.",
  "默认：Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct Q4_K_M + llama.cpp CPU。\n更大的本地模型可替换为兼容的本机接口。模型质量、速度取决于机器配置。\nAI决定阵容、战术、换人、续约与报价；游戏规则只负责验证和执行。": "Default: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct Q4_K_M + llama.cpp CPU.",
  "你是中场休息的足球教练。自主决定tactic和substitutions；可不换人，返回空数组。slot为0前左1前中2前右3中左4中中5中右6后左7后中8后右9门将。只能选择可换入code，每人只换一次。只输出指定JSON和简短中文reason。": "You are the football coach during halftime. Decide the tactic and substitutions; you can not change the players, return an empty array. Slot: 0 - left, 1 - middle, 2 - right, 3 - middle left, 4 - middle middle, 5 - middle right, 6 - left back, 7 - middle back, 8 - right back, 9 - goalkeeper. Only choose a code that can be replaced, and each player can only be replaced once. Only output the specified JSON and a concise Chinese reason.",
  "你是足球俱乐部主教练。根据本队理念、对手与目标，从候选阵容工具结果中自主选择plan。不要机械地选最高分，需要考虑战术相克。只输出JSON：plan为编号，reason为一句中文。不要抄写球员资料。每场仅一种战术，reason不可声称叠加战术或捏造规则。": "You are the club coach. Based on the team's philosophy, opponents, and goals, autonomously choose a plan from the candidate lineup tool results. Do not mechanically select the highest score, need to consider tactical compatibility. Only output JSON: plan as a number, reason as a Chinese sentence. Do not copy player data. Each game only one tactic, reason cannot claim to combine tactics or fabricate rules.",
  "你是俱乐部经营经理，独立决策转会。acceptOffers与rejectOffers只填写需回应的报价ID，可为空。不同时接受和拒绝同一报价。若有市场，可在offers提出至多3次购买，费用至少为市场fee；挂牌listPlayers用本队code。工资等于全队身价，买人后要保留工资。不需要买人可空。只输出指定JSON，reason简短中文。": "You are the club manager in charge of transfers. Only accept or reject offers. Only fill in the ID of the offer that needs to be responded to. Do not accept and reject the same offer at the same time. If there is a market, you can buy up to 3 times, the fee must be at least the market fee; use listPlayers with the team code. The salary equals the total team value, after buying, you must retain the salary. Do not buy players, you can return an empty array. Only output the specified JSON and a concise Chinese reason.",
